		"introHTML": "<p><strong>This lesson helps you talk about who you are in French.</strong> You will practise introducing yourself, describing your personal situation and profession, and answering common personal questions politely. Through listening and speaking tasks, you will also improve key pronunciation patterns for clearer, more natural French.</p>",
		"informationHTML": "<h3>You will learn:</h3><ul><li>How to introduce yourself and describe your situation (for example <em>célibataire</em>, <em>marié(e)</em>, professions).</li><li>How to use the verb <em>être</em> with common subject pronouns.</li><li>How grammatical gender affects articles and agreement in everyday expressions.</li><li>How to recognise and produce key pronunciation features, including silent final consonants and <em>th</em>.</li><li>How to respond accurately in guided listening and interactive practice activities.</li></ul>"
	},
